  plt.yticks(())\n45 |     if i == 1:\n46 |         plt.title('Original data')\n47 |     plt.subplot(3, 4, 4 + i + 1)\n48 |     plt.imshow(images_restored[i], cmap=plt.cm.gray, vmax=16,\n49 |                interpolation='nearest')\n50 |     if i == 1:\n51 |         plt.title('Agglomerated data')\n52 |     plt.xticks(())\n53 |     plt.yticks(())\n54 | \n55 | plt.subplot(3, 4, 10)\n56 | plt.imshow(np.reshape(agglo.labels_, images[0].shape),\n57 |            interpolation='nearest', cmap=plt.cm.nipy_spectral)\n58 | plt.xticks(())\n59 | plt.yticks(())\n60 | plt.title('Labels')\n61 | plt.show()\n62 | \n```\n\nFound function `benchmarks/bench_rcv1_logreg_convergence.py:plot_train_losses`.\nSource: Retrieved code content using keyword search (bm25).\n```\n103 | def plot_train_losses(clfs):\n104 |     plt.figure()\n105 |     for (name, _, _, train_losses, _, _, durations) in clfs:\n106 |         plt.plot(durations, train_losses, \"-o\", label=name)\n107 |         plt.legend(loc=0)\n108 |         plt.xlabel(\"seconds\")\n109 |         plt.ylabel(\"train loss\")\n```\n\nFound function `benchmarks/bench_rcv1_logreg_convergence.py:plot_train_scores`.\nSource: Retrieved code content using keyword search (bm25).\n```\n112 | def plot_train_scores(clfs):\n113 |     plt.figure()\n114 |     for (name, _, _, _, train_scores, _, durations) in clfs:\n115 |         plt.plot(durations, train_scores, \"-o\", label=name)\n116 |         plt.legend(loc=0)\n117 |         plt.xlabel(\"seconds\")\n118 |         plt.ylabel(\"train score\")\n119 |         plt.ylim((0.92, 0.96))\n```\n\nFound function `benchmarks/bench_rcv1_logreg_convergence.py:plot_test_scores`.\nSource: Retrieved code content using keyword search (bm25).\n```\n122 | def plot_test_scores(clfs):\n123 |     plt.figure()\n124 |     for (name, _, _, _, _, test_scores, durations) in clfs:\n125 |         plt.plot(durations, test_scores, \"-o\", label=name)\n126 |         plt.legend(loc=0)\n127 |         plt.xlabel(\"seconds\")\n128 | 